<title>USA: C-Cube Microsystems sees lower Q2 net.</title>
<headline>C-Cube Microsystems sees lower Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>C-Cube Microsystems Inc said Tuesday it will report lower than expected earnings for the second quarter, with earnings per share of between $0.20 and $0.25 and revenues of about $70 million to $75 million.</p>
<p>C-Cube said its second quarter ends June 30.</p>
<p>The company reported revenues and earnings of $94 million and $0.41, respectively, for its first quarter ended March 31. It reported revenues of $73 million and earnings per share of $0.39 for the second quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
